LAMMPS (10 Dec 2025 - Development - patch_10Dec2025-120-ga51f9ba0e7)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# Finite-T Langevin spin-dynamics stage for the Pd/Fe/Ir(111) effective model (see
# in.pdfeir_effective.lammps for the Hamiltonian, parameters, and their provenance).
# Run via run_scan.sh, one temperature per invocation: -var runtemp <K> -var runseed <int>
#
# Segfault root cause and fix (found by bisection, 2026-08-16):
#   `fix nve/spin` + a dynamics `run` was segfaulting on the real system on every LAMMPS
#   build tried, including a from-source rebuild with the SPIN package freshly enabled
#   (10 Dec 2025 dev snapshot). Bisected on a minimal reproducer down to: LAMMPS's
#   `pair_style hybrid/overlay` segfaults during force computation whenever it wraps
#   EXACTLY TWO SPIN-package pair substyles (confirmed for spin/exchange+spin/dmi and,
#   independently, spin/exchange+spin/magelec) -- reproduces regardless of langevin/spin,
#   fix declaration order, lattice geometry/boundary, or DMI direction, and is NOT specific
#   to this system: examples/SPIN/bfo (which combines exchange+magelec+dmi, THREE
#   substyles) ships with LAMMPS and runs fine on the exact same build. Adding a third,
#   physically-inert (zero-strength) spin/magelec substyle to pad hybrid/overlay to three
#   substyles avoids the crash entirely -- verified against this real system (600-atom
#   scaled check, 500-step Langevin run, smooth non-NaN energy relaxation) before adopting
#   it here. This is a LAMMPS bug (not a modeling error); the padding is a workaround,
#   not a physics change (magelec coefficient is exactly 0).

units           metal
atom_style      spin
dimension       3
boundary        p p f
atom_modify     map array

read_restart    restart.pdfeir_T0.equil
Reading restart file ...
  restart file = 10 Dec 2025, LAMMPS = 10 Dec 2025
  restoring atom style spin from restart
  orthogonal box = (0 0 -1.3575) to (407.25 235.1259 1.3575)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  restoring pair style hybrid/overlay from restart
  15000 atoms
  read_restart CPU = 0.003 seconds

variable        rnn equal 2.715
variable        j_eff_eV equal 0.00368
variable        exch_a equal v_j_eff_eV*2.718281828/4.0
variable        rc_exch equal 1.2*${rnn}
variable        rc_exch equal 1.2*2.715
variable        d_eV equal 0.00139
variable        rc_dmi equal 1.2*${rnn}
variable        rc_dmi equal 1.2*2.715
variable        k_eV equal -0.0007

# --- workaround: pad hybrid/overlay to 3 spin substyles, see note above ---
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange ${rc_exch} spin/dmi ${rc_dmi} spin/magelec ${rc_exch}
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 3.258 spin/dmi ${rc_dmi} spin/magelec ${rc_exch}
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 3.258 spin/dmi 3.258 spin/magelec ${rc_exch}
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 3.258 spin/dmi 3.258 spin/magelec 3.258
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange ${rc_exch} ${exch_a} 0.0 ${rnn} offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 3.258 ${exch_a} 0.0 ${rnn} offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 3.258 0.00250081928176 0.0 ${rnn} offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 3.258 0.00250081928176 0.0 2.715 offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/dmi dmi ${rc_dmi} ${d_eV} 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * spin/dmi dmi 3.258 ${d_eV} 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * spin/dmi dmi 3.258 0.00139 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * spin/magelec magelec ${rc_exch} 0.0 1.0 1.0 1.0   # zero strength: workaround only
pair_coeff      * * spin/magelec magelec 3.258 0.0 1.0 1.0 1.0   

neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 check yes delay 20

fix             1 all precession/spin zeeman 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 anisotropy ${k_eV} 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix             1 all precession/spin zeeman 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 anisotropy -0.0007 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix_modify      1 energy yes
fix             2 all langevin/spin ${runtemp} 0.05 ${runseed}
fix             2 all langevin/spin 190 0.05 ${runseed}
fix             2 all langevin/spin 190 0.05 63
fix             3 all nve/spin lattice frozen

timestep        0.0001

compute         out_mag all spin
compute         outsp all property/atom spx spy spz sp
thermo_style    custom step time temp pe etotal c_out_mag[4] c_out_mag[5]
thermo          200

dump            1 all custom 500 dump_pdfeir_T${runtemp}_s${runseed}.lammpstrj type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3]
dump            1 all custom 500 dump_pdfeir_T190_s${runseed}.lammpstrj type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3]
dump            1 all custom 500 dump_pdfeir_T190_s63.lammpstrj type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3]

# Equilibrate then production sample. 20k steps @ dt=0.0001 ps = 2 ps -- short first pass;
# extend once the T_c ~214K checkpoint from the paper needs finer sampling.
run             20000

